:"","link":{"href":"/comparison-of-bartesian-models-340793"}},{"id":"694713","title":"2026 Bartesian Advent Calendar Preorder","excerpt":"How the Advent calendar preorder works:. Upon placing your preorder you'll receive a unique preorder redemption code in your confirmation email. We recommend you save/bookmark your code for reference. Preorders do not count towards your free shipping","link":{"href":"/2026-bartesian-advent-calendar-preorder-694713"}},{"id":"1222991","title":"How to: Log in to Bartesian.com account","excerpt":"Experiencing issues or errors logging in?","link":{"href":"/how-to-log-in-to-bartesiancom-account-1222991"}},{"id":"2662981","title":"2026 Advent calendar redemption assistance/questions","excerpt":"Q: I do not see how to add calendars to my cart. A: Please ensure you are logged into a Bartesian.com account using the same email address that was used to place the pre-order and where the redemption notice/code was sent. If you do not see the optio","link":{"href":"/2026-advent-calendar-redemption-assistancequestions-2662981"}},{"id":"5988707","title":"Where can I find Bartesian in stores?","excerpt":"Find the Bartesian cocktail maker and capsules in retail stores throughout the US using the store locator linked here. Click here to find Bartesian retail store partner locations with the US. Selection Varies by Location. Cocktail availability differ","link":{"href":"/where-can-i-find-bartesian-in-stores-5988707"}}],"children":[]},{"id":"8410","title":"Nutritional Information","link":{"href":"/articles/nutritional-information-8410"},"articles":[{"id":"42971","title":"Do the capsules expire?","excerpt":"The dating on the packaging is a presentation guideline that is significantly different from an expiration or safety date. Regrettably, confusion between the two contributes to a significant amount of food waste in North America each year. Bartesian","link":{"href":"/do-the-capsules-expire-42971"}},{"id":"2440620","title":"Percentage Juice (US)","excerpt":"What does \"Contains X% Juice\" on US labels mean?. This statement indicates the percentage of real fruit or vegetable juice in each Bartesian cocktail mix. Our carefully crafted cocktail capsules use premium juice ingredients to deliver an authentic c","link":{"href":"/percentage-juice-(us)-2440620"}}],"children":[{"id":"324907","title":"Vodka Cocktails","link":{"href":"/articles/vodka-cocktails-324907"},"articles":[{"id":"502336","title":"19th Hole","excerpt":"A delicious sipper on and off the links, the 19th Hole is a refreshing vodka cocktail celebrating the classic combination of sweet lemonade and refreshing black tea flavors. Enjoy over ice in a highball glass garnished with a lemon wedge. Base Spirit","link":{"href":"/19th-hole-502336"}},{"id":"35050","title":"Amaretto Sour","excerpt":"The Amaretto Sour pairs nutty almond and orange citrus notes to make for the perfect vodka dessert cocktail. Whether you’re enjoying it for dessert, brunch, or any other time of day, this cocktail is sophisticated and refreshing all at once. Base Spi","link":{"href":"/amaretto-sour-35050"}},{"id":"36517","title":"Apple Pie","excerpt":"Your favorite dessert is served as a cocktail. The sweet combination of baked apple and fall spices is perfectly balanced with hints of lemon and cayenne in this whiskey and vodka cocktail. Wonderfully reminiscent of a slice of grandma's apple pie. B","link":{"href":"/apple-pie-36517"}},{"id":"1661998","title":"Blueberry Lemon Drop","excerpt":"Jammy, refreshingly tart, and delicately floral, this twist on the Lemon Drop is bursting with sweet, candied blueberry balanced with bright citrus flavors. Shake and serve in a martini glass garnished with a sugar rim, lemon peel, and blueberries. B","link":{"href":"/blueberry-lemon-drop-1661998"}},{"id":"38999","title":"Cosmopolitan","excerpt":"Tart cranberry is balanced out by the citrus of lime and sweetness of orange to create this classic vodka cocktail. Base Spirit: Vodka. Recommended Glasswar